=== (c) how many collision events does the headline gain represent? ===

COMPARISON                                      delta pp    n=6019    n=5000    n=4819    n=4000
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VAD-Base -> E3AD(VAD-Base), avg collision           0.04       2.4       2.0       1.9       1.6
VAD-Base -> E3AD(VAD-Base), 3 s collision           0.05       3.0       2.5       2.4       2.0
UniAD -> E3AD(UniAD), avg collision                 0.08       4.8       4.0       3.9       3.2
best vs 2nd-best sweep row (A.4), avg col           0.02       1.2       1.0       1.0       0.8

  -> cells are the number of scored samples whose collision verdict must flip
     to produce the reported difference. Every headline open-loop gain in the
     paper is a single-seed difference of ~2-5 collision events.

